From: Emerald Tablet <emeraldtablet@local>
Subject: [PATCH] iOS: resolve physical iPad usability debt
Purpose: Fix case-sensitive campaign maps, deterministic menu navigation, touch gestures, text-input focus, persistent native controls, tablet backgrounds, sound steps, indirect input, and the app-icon catalog.
Upstream status: Candidate after hardware validation; the native overlay and wrapper branding remain Apple-specific.
Tests: Wrapper safety checks, Simulator/device builds and audits, followed by preservation-safe physical iPad validation.

